  "image": "/images/posts/15380.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En la Municipalidad de Maullín se realizó una reunión de orientación con familias que participan del proceso de postulación al Subsidio Habitacional Rural DS10 2026.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La jornada permitió resolver dudas y entregar antecedentes sobre los requisitos del programa, entre ellos pertenecer hasta el 60% del Registro Social de Hogares y acreditar la disponibilidad del terreno.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Este año, el proceso contempla el acompañamiento de 10 familias de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/> La iniciativa busca apoyar a las familias rurales para que puedan avanzar en el acceso a una solución habitacional.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZhYbu-vHWRPPOKBobwtYwfYNsQG3yOcjyvIHHA3QJCHpuaMnMwj5PrMKvlzfzTQVt01tWNym6glX7ArF4vU-yj6ffTjyILF31olctNHNAj0wBbGrphje55LGBmbpLaMsM5vfNOjyT8&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/viviendarural?__cft__[0]=AZhYbu-vHWRPPOKBobwtYwfYNsQG3yOcjyvIHHA3QJCHpuaMnMwj5PrMKvlzfzTQVt01tWNym6glX7ArF4vU-yj6ffTjyILF31olctNHNAj0wBbGrphje55LGBmbpLaMsM5vfNOjyT8&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#ViviendaRural</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/subsidiohabitacional?__cft__[0]=AZhYbu-vHWRPPOKBobwtYwfYNsQG3yOcjyvIHHA3QJCHpuaMnMwj5PrMKvlzfzTQVt01tWNym6glX7ArF4vU-yj6ffTjyILF31olctNHNAj0wBbGrphje55LGBmbpLaMsM5vfNOjyT8&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#SubsidioHabitacional</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15384\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/0h8ki6jmkr8ei8q/subs_04_b_1024x683_ta7hufpgkr.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15387\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/v5m6nyj08t9qzdr/subs_07_b_1024x683_4ekc7o4z18.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-12 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15383\" data-id=\"15383\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5rxn4yzohylylm9/subs_05_b_1024x683_q7rossieka.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15386\" data-id=\"15386\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/6m9j0scrdft9cgn/subs_06_b_1024x683_t5kmomfllf.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15382\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/8geojvnehi5v4ou/subs_03_b_1024x683_w1ba0gix7c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large